				<r3d:description language="eng">FoDaSi is the Research Data Repository of Siegen University for the long-term storage and/or publication of digital research data, university publications and other digital objects. It provides structured worldwide access as well as versioning and reusability of data. FoDaSi is understood as a supplement to interdisciplinary repositories and is also aimed at researchers who cannot use suitable storage locations for their research data in their disciplines.</r3d:description>
